### Lab 06: Relational Schemas, Foreign Keys, and SQL Joins
### Tested with VS Code REST Client

### 1. Fetch All Authors
GET http://localhost:3000/authors/
Accept: application/json

### 2. Create a New Author
POST http://localhost:3000/authors/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Douglas Adams",
  "email": "adams@galaxy.org",
  "country": "United Kingdom"
}

### 3. Fetch Books by Specific Author (Author ID 1)
GET http://localhost:3000/authors/1/books/
Accept: application/json

### 4. Fetch Books with Author Details via SQL INNER JOIN
GET http://localhost:3000/books-with-authors/
Accept: application/json

### 5. Fetch Author Publishing Stats via SQL LEFT JOIN & GROUP BY
GET http://localhost:3000/authors-stats/
Accept: application/json
